          "title": "In the Blind: Building Pseudo-References for MT Evaluation",
          "title_zh": "盲评之下：为机器翻译评测构建伪参考译文",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2609.13611v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "arxiv_other",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2609.13611",
          "summary": "The paper describes how pseudo-references were built for 10 reference-free language pairs in the WMT26 General MT task plus six pairs with some human references: seven models translate 3,277 documents under up to five prompt conditions, three reference-free quality estimation models score candidates, and a per-document selector picks one translation that GPT-5.5 post-edits where needed. Adding a confidence-scaled language-identification penalty drove wrong-language selections to zero, and the released human evaluation shows the references match the strongest participating systems when the selector kept a frontier-model candidate.",
